OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start, but staying
OL,6,Fmainly dry and bright with some sunny
OL,7,Fspells. However, there will be a
OL,8,Fscattering of showers. Light or
OL,9,Fmoderate west or northwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and often clear this
OL,12,Fevening and chilly with a touch of
OL,13,Ffrost in places. Cloud could increase
OL,14,Fovernight with the odd shower, these
OL,15,Fmainly over the hills.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FMainly dry and bright with
OL,18,Foccasional sunny breaks. Cloudier at
OL,19,Ftimes with isolated showers. Winds
OL,20,Fwill be light from the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
